<!-- Foreground layer for the adaptive launcher icon: the same hand-drawn eye/bird symbol
     used as the web app's favicon (docs/icon.svg) and in its header next to the wordmark —
     this is the one piece of that branding the Android app was missing a real launcher icon
     for (it was using a generic system icon, android:drawable/ic_menu_view). The inner group
     shrinks and centers the symbol within the adaptive icon's safe zone so launchers that
     mask to a circle/squircle don't clip it. -->
